"description":"Want to place an express bet but are too lazy to analyze the line, find the best options and check the odds? \"ComboBet Generator\" does all the work for you. The application analyzes the user's bets from various sources and from our own huge closed database. The application collects the top results, taking into account statistical data, the frequency of each result, details about the author and various other criteria, to compile the best express bets for you. Your role is simply to decide whether you like them or not.\n\nWe offer the following features to our users:\n\n1. Random Expresses\nThe generator selects the optimal parameters and creates expresses based on them.\n2. Custom Expresses\nThe user can set custom parameters according to his needs. You can configure\n* 12 types of sports\n* Exact leagues\n* Odds range for each event\n* Total number of events\n* Event start times\nAll express bets in the constructor will be created based on the settings specified by the user.\n3. Preset Templates\nThe user can select pre-configured templates and customize them to suit the user's needs.\n4. User templates\nThe user can save his constructor settings as templates and keep them in his profile for future use.\n\nYou can like/dislike the generated express bet cards (by simply swiping right/left as in the famous app) and track the results of the liked ones.\n\nWe believe that \"ComboBet Generator\" will improve your betting performance or simply provide you with entertainment.\n\nThe ComboBet Generator application is subject to Apple's standard terms and conditions (EULA) https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "minimumOsVersion":"12.4", "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2024-06-19T13:35:05Z", "userRatingCount":5}]
